"## CHAPTER 01 — A Beautiful Mistake 💌\n\n**En anbirkuriya Seetha Mahalakshmi avargale…**\n\nFirst of all, oru chinna warning!\n\nIndha website-ah open pannadhu ungal vaazhkaiyil neenga panna romba azhagaana thappa irukkalaam. 😂\n\nYen-nu kekkureengala?\n\nOru naal, oru paiyan unga sirippa rasikka aarambichaan.\n\nAppuram unga pecha rasichaan.\n\nAppuram unga kobathayum rasikka aarambichaan.\n\nIppo avan nilamai enna theriyuma?\n\n**Neenga edhu senjaalum rasikkiraan… neenga edhuvum seyyalainaalum ungala rasikkiraan!**\n\nPaavam, avanukku treatment irukkaa-nu theriyala.\n\nAana indha kadhaiyai padikka ungalukku konjam neram irukkaa, madam?\n\n**Buttons:**\n- 💌 Tell me your story\n- 🙄 Again, indha paiyana? — *moves playfully*\n\n*When the button escapes:*\n\n\"Escape aaguradhu ungalukku romba pidikkum pola… enna madam, indha website-kum unga character therinjiruchaa?\" 😂\n\n---\n\n## CHAPTER 02 — An Unfair Competition ✈️\n\nMahalakshmi avargale…\n\nOru serious complaint.\n\nUngalukku aeroplanes mela ivlo kaadhal irukkuradhu konjam unfair!\n\nOru aeroplane vaanathula parandhaa, adha paarthu kannu imaikkaama rasippeenga.\n\nAana naan ungala paarthu rasichaa…\n\n\"Enna paakura?\" nu keppeenga!\n\n**Adhu enna niyaayam, madam?**\n\nAndha vimaanathukkum enakkum enna vithiyaasam?\n\nAdhu vaanathula parakkudhu…\n\n**Naan ungala paakkumbodhellaam parakkuren.**\n\nAdhukku engines irukku.\n\nEnakku unga oru chinna sirippu podhum! 😂❤️\n\n**Buttons:**\n- ✈️ Still, I love aeroplanes!\n- 🤭 Seri, konjam cute dhaan\n\n*If she chooses aeroplanes:*\n\n\"Appo competition Boeing-kooda dhaana? Seri madam, naanum oru naal unga favourite destination aaguren-nu paakuren!\"\n\n---\n\n## CHAPTER 03 — The Sunset That Never Ended 🌅\n\nMahalakshmi…\n\nUnakku nyabagam irukkaa?\n\nNaama serndhu sunset rasicha andha maalai nerangal…\n\nAndha nerathula vaanam evvalo azhagaa irundhuchu.\n\nSooriyan medhuvaa maraindhaan.\n\nMegangal niram maarichu.\n\nNeram namakku theriyaama kadandhuchu.\n\nAana ippo yosichu paathaa…\n\nAndha sunset-oda colours kooda sariya nyabagam illa.\n\n**Aana andha vaanathukku keezha nee en pakkathula irundhadhu mattum innum marakkala.**\n\nEnna oru kodumai paaru…\n\nAndha sooriyan annaikke maraindhuttaan.\n\n**Aana andha maalai mattum en manasula innum mudiyala.**\n\nAnd honestly…\n\nAndha sunset-ah innoru murai paakkanumnu enakku aasai illa.\n\n**Andha sunset-ah un kooda innoru murai paakkanum-nu dhaan aasai.**\n\nOru chinna doubt, madam…\n\nAndha maalaiyil nee vaanatha rasichiya?\n\nIllai, un pakkathula irundha oru paithiyatha konjamavadhu gavanichiya? 🤭❤️\n\n**Buttons:**\n- 🌅 One more sunset?\n- 🙄 Sunset-ah vidave maattiyaa? — *moves once*\n\n*Dodging response:*\n\n\"Sunset-ah vittuduren madam… aana andha maalaiya enna panna solreenga?\"\n\n---\n\n## CHAPTER 04 — A Little Too Close 🤍\n\nSeetha Mahalakshmi avargale…\n\nNaan oru decent gentleman dhaan.\n\nAt least, un pakkathula illaadha varaikkum! 😂\n\nOru naal nee en pakkathula romba nerukkama ukkaandhirundhaa…\n\nUn thol en thola lesa urasinaa…\n\nNaan pesittu irundha vaarthai engayo poidum.\n\nNee, \"Enna aachu?\" nu keppa.\n\nNaan, \"Onnum illa\" nu solluven.\n\nAana en manasukkulla…\n\n**\"Aiyo, indha ponnu konjam innum nerunginaa en idhayam enna aagum?\"**\n\nNee enna paathu sirichaa, naanum sirippen.\n\nAana oru sila nerangalil…\n\nUn kannai paarkira en paarvai, theriyama un idhazhgalil oru nodi nindruvidum.\n\nAppuram avasarama vera pakkam thirumbiduven.\n\nYen theriyuma?\n\n**Unnai muthamida aasai varala-nu poi solla maatten… aana andha aasaiyai vida, nee en arugil nimmadhiya irukkanum-ngira aasai dhaan perusu.**\n\nIdhellaam un kitta sonnaa nee enna solluva?\n\n\"Dei, nee romba mosam!\" nu dhaane? 😂❤️\n\n**Buttons:**\n- 🤭 Aama, konjam mosam dhaan!\n- ❤️ Maybe I wouldn't mind\n\n---\n\n## CHAPTER 05 — Six Strings & One Heartbeat 🎸\n\nMahalakshmi…\n\nEn guitar-la aaru strings irukku.\n\nOvvoru string-um oru different sound.\n\nAana nee pakkathula irundhaa…\n\nEnakku music-oda rhythm kooda konjam thappipogum.\n\nImagine…\n\nOru amaidhiyaana iravu.\n\nNee en pakkathula ukkaandhirukka.\n\nNaan unakkaaga oru melody vaasikkiren.\n\nNee medhuvaa en tholil saanjukura.\n\nUn koondhal en kannathula urasudhu.\n\nAndha nimishathula…\n\n**En guitar isaiyai niruthidum… aana en idhayam adha vida azhagaana oru melody vaasikka aarambikkum.**\n\nAppo nee, \"Yen vaasikkuradha niruthitta?\" nu keppa.\n\nNaan solluven…\n\n**\"Paattu nallaa irundhuchu, kanmani… aana indha silence adha vida azhagaa irukke.\"**\n\nAppuram?\n\nAppuram enna…\n\nNee enna muraippa.\n\nNaan adutha chord-ah vaasikka aarambippen! 😂\n\n**Buttons:**\n- 🎸 Play our little melody\n- ❤️ Stay here a little longer\n\n---\n\n## CHAPTER 06 — An Ordinary Life With You 🌙\n\nKanmani…\n\nEnakku un kooda oru cinematic love story venum-nu illa.\n\nEvery day romance, flowers, surprises…\n\nAdhellaam azhagu dhaan.\n\nAana enakku adha vida pidicha oru kanavu irukku.\n\nOru ordinary Sunday.\n\nNee late-ah ezhundhirukkanum.\n\nNaan coffee pottuttu varanum.\n\nNee, \"Innum konjam thoonganum\" nu sollanum.\n\nNaan, \"Seri, thoongu\" nu sollittu…\n\nUn pakkathula amaidhiya ukkaandhirukkanum.\n\nNee kannai moodittu, \"Enna paathuttu irukka?\" nu kekkanum.\n\nNaan, \"Onnum illa\" nu sollanum.\n\nNee sirikkanum.\n\n**Andha sirippukku munnadi enakku coffee-yum vendaam… kaalai sooriyanum vendaam.**\n\nAppuram rendu perum sandai podalaam.\n\nNaan unnai kindal pannalaam.\n\nNee enna thittalaam.\n\nAana andha naalin mudivil…\n\n**Unakku sandhosham vandhaal solla thonura mudhal aal naan irukkanum.**\n\n**Unakku kashtam vandhaal bayam illaama pesa mudiyura oru aal naan irukkanum.**\n\nNee en vaazhkaiyoda oru chapter-ah mattum irukkanumnu aasai illa, kanmani.\n\n**Un kooda serndhu, innum ezhudhaadha pala pakkangalai vaazhnthu paakkanumnu aasai.**\n\n**Button:**\n- 💌 Then tell me what you really want…\n\n---\n\n## CHAPTER 07 — The Question I Saved For Last ❤️\n\n**En iniya Seetha Mahalakshmi…**\n\nIdhuvaraikkum naan unna sirikka vaikka try pannen.\n\nKonjam flirt pannen.\n\nKonjam over-ah kavidhai sonnen.\n\nAana ippo, oru chinna unmai.\n\nUnakku unnudaiya kanavugal irukku.\n\nUnakku pidicha vaanam irukku.\n\nNee parakka ninaikkira uyarangal irukku.\n\nNaan un kooda irukkanumnu aasaippadradhukkaaga, andha kanavugalil edhaiyum nee vittukkodukka vendaam.\n\nEnakku un kooda ellaa naalum sandhoshama iruppom-nu promise panna theriyadhu.\n\nAana…\n\nNee sirikkumbodhu adha rasikka aasai.\n\nNee azhumbodhu un pakkathula irukka aasai.\n\nNee vetri perumbodhu unna vida adhigama sandhoshappada aasai.\n\n**Unnai enakkaaga maathikka aasai illa.**\n\n**Nee neeyaagave irukkumbodhu, unnai kaadhalikka dhaan aasai.**\n\nNamma serndhu rasicha andha maalai nerangal nyabagam irukkaa?\n\nAndha naalil sooriyan maraindhaan.\n\nNamma rendu perum veettukku thirumbinom.\n\nAana andha ninaivugal mattum en koodave vandhuchu.\n\nIndha vaazhkaiyil innum eththanai sunsets irukku-nu enakku theriyadhu.\n\nAana…\n\n**Andha sunsets-la sila un koodave irundhaa, adhu podhum-nu en manasu solludhu.**\n\nSo, my dear Kanmani…\n\nOru kadaisi kelvi.\n\n**\"Un vaazhkaiyil nee parakka ninaikkira vaanathai naan thadukka maatten… aana andha vaanathai un kooda serndhu rasikka, enakkum oru vaaippu tharuviyaa?\"**\n\n**\"Will you give us a chance to fall in love?\"** ❤️\n\n**Buttons:**\n- ❤️ Yes, let's begin our story\n- 🌙 I need more time\n- 💌 I don't feel the same way\n\n---\n\n## ENDING — If She Says Yes ❤️\n\n**Mahalakshmi avargale…**\n\nOru nimisham…\n\nNaan ivvalavu neram dialogue pesinen.\n\nNee ore oru vaarthai solli ennai silent aakkittiye!\n\nIdhu konjam unfair illa? 😂\n\nEn manasukkulla aayiram guitar-gal ore nerathula vaasikkudhu.\n\nAndha sunsets-ku ippo oru pudhu artham kidaichirukku.\n\n**Andha naal namma rendu perum serndhu sunset rasichom…**\n\n**Inime namakku pidichirundhaa, namma kadhaiyoda adutha sunset-ah serndhu rasikkalaam.**\n\nIppadikku,\n\nUn sirippil tholaindhavan,  \nUn kobathilum azhagai kandavan,  \nUn kooda innum pala maalai nerangalai rasikka virumbum,\n\n**Un kaadhalan.** ❤️\n\n---\n\n## ENDING — If She Needs Time 🌙\n\nMahalakshmi…\n\nNaan kavidhai ezhudhalaam.\n\nUnakkaaga guitar vaasikkalaam.\n\nUnnai sirikka vaikkalaam.\n\nAana un manasu solla vendiya badhilai naan ezhudha mudiyaadhu.\n\nAdhu unnudaiyadhu.\n\n**Take your time, kanmani.**\n\nIndha kadhaiyila unakku pidicha oru chinna nimisham irundhaalum, adhu enakku podhum.\n\n---\n\n## ENDING — Aiyayo, Again NO-va? 💔😂\n\nSeetha Mahalakshmi avargale…\n\nAiyayo! Indha button-ah dhaan click pannanumaa? 😂\n\nSeri pa… oru chinna unmai.\n\n**Naan maaritten pa. Romba maaritten.**\n\nMunnaadi irundha naanum, ippo irukkura naanum onnu illa.\n\nAana enna dhaan maarinaalum…\n\n**Unnai miss panra andha chinna pazhakkam mattum ennai vittu pogave maattengudhu.** 🥹\n\nNamma serndhu rasicha andha sunsets innum nyabagam irukku.\n\nAndha maalai neratha thirumba kondu vara mudiyaadhu… un badhilaiyum naan maatha ninaikkala.\n\nSeri, madam…\n\nIndha muraiyum namma hero-vukku climax konjam sogam dhaan pola! 😂\n\n**But wait… indha aaloda imagination-ku mattum retirement illa!**\n\nI'll be back with another crazy idea… or maybe just another silly way to make you smile, if you'd like that.\n\nUn badhilai maatha illa… indha sirippa marakka mudiyadhadhunaala! ❤️\n\n**Ippadikku,**\n\nKaadhalil konjam unlucky,\nKavidhaiyil romba over,\nThotraalum comedy-ah vidaadha,\n\n**Ungal anbin munnal vinnappadhaarar!** 😂\n\n*Hate you.*"
